messages.text:
The thing about water is that it's
always changing...{be01}
From the piercing strength of a jet,
to the crushing power of a wave...{be00}
That's what I'm about to show you!{be01}

What strength...{be01}
You're just as strong as Marlon...or
perhaps even stronger...?!

You know... Each Trainer has different
Pokémon, and Pokémon all have their{be00}
own strengths.{be01}
I've got to learn more about the
strengths of my own Pokémon!
